OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers dying out during the evening.
OL,7,FRain and hill snow will arrive from
OL,8,Fthe west overnight and spread
OL,9,Feastwards across all parts. Very windy
OL,10,Fwith gales near coasts and over high
OL,11,Fground.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA wet start to the day. Rain
OL,14,Fand hill snow clearing eastwards
OL,15,Fthrough the morning, this will allow
OL,16,Fsome sunny spells to develop through
OL,17,Fthe afternoon. Winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
