OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy,
OL,6,Fwith some light rain or drizzle
OL,7,Fpossible Saturday. Mostly dry with
OL,8,Fbright spells on Sunday, but the odd
OL,9,Fshower possible. Much milder with
OL,10,Foutbreaks of rain on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
